      <rules>
        <rule name="Bear Handler" id="6fe1-79a2-585c-1b1f" hidden="false">
          <description>A Kislevite warband that includes a Bear Tamer is allowed to purchase a Bear as a henchman.
This bear has been trained to follow the Tamer&apos;s commands, and so will automatically pass its Stupidity tests when within 6&quot; of the Bear Tamer (even if tha Tamer has been Knocked Down or Stunned).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
