      <rules>
        <rule name="Hate Chaos" id="d2fd-bdf0-ef65-83ba" hidden="false">
          <description>Years of bitter struggle against the forces of Chaos have left their mark on the Cossack people.
Cossacks are subject to Hatred against all forces of Chaos (eg. members of any warband the players would apply the Ancient Enemies special rule to).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
