      <rules>
        <rule name="Gun-Rest" id="cfa3-4adb-1187-252b" hidden="false">
          <description>A Streltsi warrior armed with both halberd and handgun may use the halberd as a gun-rest.

The warrior receives a +1 on his &apos;to hit&apos; roll with the handgun, as long as he did not move that turn (this applies even if the warrior has a skill that allows him to move &amp; shoot with his handgun - he must not move if he is to rest the gun).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
